Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.58,0:00:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,A new breeze in the clear skies
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.83,0:00:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Brings in new days enveloped in happiness
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.42,0:00:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,A sprouting dream
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.25,0:00:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shines light on
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.04,0:00:34.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our modest life
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.25,0:00:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things feel even more fun
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.33,0:00:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Than they were yesterday
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.25,0:00:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And my heart races
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.29,0:00:45.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Along the long path
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.38,0:00:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if you stop or grow worried
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.17,0:00:54.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take a slow, deep breath
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.75,0:00:58.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,And continue at your own pace
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.04,0:01:00.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Beautiful life
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.33,0:01:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every time you walk
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.92,0:01:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll find sights you've never seen
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.25,0:01:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,New encounters come out of nowhere
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.00,0:01:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,When our feelings intertwine
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.75,0:01:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It is surely a sign of irreplaceable
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.13,0:01:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wonderful days when we all laugh together
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.17,0:01:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a beautiful story
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.25,0:01:40.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.08,0:01:43.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now this one's a beauty.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.04,0:01:44.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll clean it off.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.67,0:01:45.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.38,0:01:50.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,All set.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.58,0:01:51.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.83,0:01:52.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.79,0:01:58.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sweet and delicious!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.75,0:02:01.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,We should make some fresh salad with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.58,0:02:04.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Could I try some?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.38,0:02:07.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sure, if you don't mind biting the same one.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.63,0:02:11.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Spicy!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.54,0:02:18.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, you took a bite from that end?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.79,0:02:23.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,The pointy end is spicy,\Nso it's better used making pickles.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.71,0:02:25.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,You could have warned me!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.75,0:02:26.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.33,0:02:29.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,We can never have too many non-perishables.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.00,0:02:32.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can make lots of pickles.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.38,0:02:38.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I guess we can also make some dried daikon.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,How do we do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.88,0:02:42.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Cut them and dry them, I guess?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.17,0:02:44.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Mister Mayor!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.50,0:02:46.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.67,0:02:49.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Some weird people are here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.88,0:02:52.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Weird people?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.04,0:02:57.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yup, definitely weird people!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.58,0:03:01.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hi there, Progenitor?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.21,0:03:02.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.67,0:03:05.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,How long has it been? You look well.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,You look well enough yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.63,0:03:12.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,So well you could kill me and I wouldn't die.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.33,0:03:14.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Or would I?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I never have, so I truly do not know.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.29,0:03:19.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, little Alfred.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.29,0:03:22.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,How long has it been?\NTwenty years, perhaps?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.21,0:03:24.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not even one, actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.25,0:03:27.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,When you live as long as I have,\Nyou lose all sense of time.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.21,0:03:29.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Who is this with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.83,0:03:31.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Your wife?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.33,0:03:32.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.71,0:03:36.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Though I am honored you think as much,\NI'm afraid I'm not.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.71,0:03:38.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,My name is Fuushu.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.50,0:03:41.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,I am but one Korin priestess.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.50,0:03:43.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm Hiraku, the mayor around here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.83,0:03:45.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's this Korin religion, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.63,0:03:48.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I never mention it?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.71,0:03:52.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,The name did come up\Nwhen we got that piano, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.38,0:03:54.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,It is essentially a conglomeration
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.21,0:03:58.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,of all the gods and religions\Nworshiped in these lands.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.54,0:04:06.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Our temple teaches that all should\Nbe free to praise their own gods.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.17,0:04:08.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's pretty broad-minded.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.42,0:04:11.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,The Progenitor leads the Korin religion.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.71,0:04:15.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'd assumed he was someone important,\Nbut that's something else.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.33,0:04:18.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,And the Great Priestess Fuushu
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.88,0:04:23.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,is someone of such stature that parades\Nare held to celebrate her presence.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.25,0:04:26.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,We need to hold a bigger reception then!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.88,0:04:28.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Your Holiness!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.38,0:04:30.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,You needn't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.21,0:04:33.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,It is my fault we pay visit unprompted.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.25,0:04:37.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes, she has a request of you.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.96,0:04:39.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,What sort of request?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.21,0:04:45.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I ask that you please save my son's life.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.54,0:04:55.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Your village is home not only to\Nthe vampire princess Lu Lulucy,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.29,0:04:59.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,the leading authority in\Nthe study of medicinal herbs,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.54,0:05:04.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,but also the great Flora Sakutou,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.33,0:05:08.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,famed seeker of knowledge\Nand an unmatched apothecary.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.71,0:05:11.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,You have need of me?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.38,0:05:13.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're that famous, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.42,0:05:17.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not to brag, but the books I write
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.00,0:05:21.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,are used as texts in every\Nschool of magic there is.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.58,0:05:25.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Tell me what your son suffers from,\Nand I will get straight to work.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.83,0:05:28.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,This will prove difficult.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.83,0:05:31.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's quite a unique case...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.88,0:05:35.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,A combination of the most\Ncomplicated illnesses imaginable.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.46,0:05:37.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I feared as much.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.58,0:05:42.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Every apothecary and healer\NI've visited has said the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.33,0:05:44.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Difficult even for the greatest, is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.33,0:05:47.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.83,0:05:53.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy, but we can't\Nsimply turn them away.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.00,0:05:55.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Right. We can figure something out.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.33,0:06:00.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,They locked themselves in\Nand set to their research.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.63,0:06:04.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I want you to get all\Nthe ingredients listed in here.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.71,0:06:06.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.13,0:06:10.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,The holy drop is a white flower\Nthat grows on snowy peaks...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.46,0:06:12.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what this is?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.63,0:06:14.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,It was brought here for Lu...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.63,0:06:15.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can handle that.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.13,0:06:18.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll fly right up to get some.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.92,0:06:24.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Next is a walking mushroom\Nthat wanders dark forests.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.63,0:06:27.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,We can handle any business in the forest!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.63,0:06:33.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,"A treasure so rare few\Ncan even dream of finding it."
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty exaggerated.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.46,0:06:39.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,"It is known as the dragon's tear..."
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.67,0:06:45.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Tickle-tickle.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Tickle-tickle.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.83,0:06:56.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is this really what I need?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.67,0:07:01.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Next, we need a dark stone\Nfrom the Gurugranth Mountains.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.13,0:07:02.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why does that sound familiar?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.92,0:07:06.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's probably the thing\Nin Dryme's lair.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.04,0:07:11.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,The one in the back that's good\Nfor propping the door open.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.54,0:07:13.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Want me to go get it?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.29,0:07:14.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,If you could.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.63,0:07:18.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,We have made our return...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.46,0:07:20.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.33,0:07:25.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,The wandering mushroom was\Nmore powerful than the stories say.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.46,0:07:27.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,How does a mushroom even get powerful?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.96,0:07:29.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.71,0:07:31.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Smaller than I thought.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.63,0:07:35.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Here are the ingredients everyone gathered
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.96,0:07:39.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,and a potted plant Michael procured for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.79,0:07:43.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Impressive as ever.\NThat's quite a rare plant.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,We'll have to be careful as we pull it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.13,0:07:48.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,How many researchers have suffered\Nso we might know?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.92,0:07:51.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is that one of those things\Nthat screams when you pull it up
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.71,0:07:53.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,and spells bad news for everyone?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.42,0:07:56.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna go for it?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Seems pretty normal to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.58,0:08:06.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,When pulled up, it releases an odor\Nstrong enough to send beasts fleeing.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.71,0:08:08.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You simply weren't fast enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.71,0:08:10.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,That... reeks!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.38,0:08:12.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's completely harmless.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,You'll just need a bath.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can handle the rest...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.21,0:08:22.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,We'd managed to gather all the ingredients,\Nbut the hard part had only just begun.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.00,0:08:26.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now we need to put the lid on, turn it to\Nthe right, and heat for ten seconds!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.13,0:08:27.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,The angle is off!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.92,0:08:31.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Their experimentation went on for days
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.63,0:08:35.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,while Fuushu remained in prayer\Nfrom morning until night.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.13,0:08:37.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,No! You can't let it get away!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.83,0:08:39.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,It went that way!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.13,0:08:41.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Settle down and be burned already!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's getting pretty late.\NYou should head inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Please pay me no mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.13,0:08:52.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Praying is all I can do.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now! Focus all your magic!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.96,0:08:57.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes! We finally have enough heat!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.04,0:08:58.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Five, four...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.75,0:09:01.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.46,0:09:02.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Blast off!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.71,0:09:10.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Goodness, is this it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.08,0:09:12.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.21,0:09:15.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this must have been\Na demanding task.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.38,0:09:18.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Save your thanks and see your son\Ntakes that right away.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.67,0:09:20.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,His condition should improve rapidly.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.83,0:09:25.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Very well, but I will return\Nthis favor someday!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.67,0:09:31.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,We will pay visit again soon enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.63,0:09:33.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Within ten years at the latest.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.88,0:09:36.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,His sense of time is all off.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.58,0:09:38.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Great work, you two.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.42,0:09:40.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's great that you pulled it off.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.21,0:09:42.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm quite exhausted.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.17,0:09:45.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,I could write several volumes\Nabout all that we discovered.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.71,0:09:49.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now to handle our remaining issues...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.25,0:09:56.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Fuushu's daily prayers left\Nour statues with a blinding glow.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.75,0:10:00.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whether that was in response\Nto her love for her child,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.50,0:10:03.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,or some divine miracle, no one knew.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.08,0:10:07.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,But its glow lasted through the night,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.04,0:10:09.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,keeping Zabuton's family awake.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.38,0:10:13.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,It does feel a tad sacrilegious,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.13,0:10:17.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,but we decided the doors would stay shut\Nexcept during times of prayer.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.71,0:10:21.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Farming Life in Another World 2!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.13,0:10:28.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Apparently you can cook them.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:30.04,0:10:33.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,It makes them softer and less tart...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.21,0:10:34.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.13,0:10:35.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.63,0:10:37.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,What kind of tree is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.54,0:10:41.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,I had completely forgotten about\Nthis experimental area.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.21,0:10:45.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,With the almighty farming tool\Nthe god granted me,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.17,0:10:48.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I was able to grow any crop I could imagine.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.13,0:10:50.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,So long as I could imagine it,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.29,0:10:52.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,I didn't need to worry about\Nseeds or anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.96,0:10:58.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sometimes that led to things growing\Nin ways I never knew.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.67,0:11:00.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sesame! Sesame! Sesame!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.25,0:11:01.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Open sesame!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.13,0:11:04.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,So that's what sesame looks like?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.54,0:11:07.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,What type of tree is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.75,0:11:10.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I honestly don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.54,0:11:16.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I remember trying to grow new things,\Nbut I don't know which one this is.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.50,0:11:21.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be too restrictive,\Nas I know this was all experimental,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.67,0:11:25.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,but we should keep a record of all the things\Nwe attempt to grow in the village.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.42,0:11:28.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,We never know what might\Nget mixed with our other crops.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.21,0:11:32.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,But what is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.96,0:11:35.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Look, it bears green fruit.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.54,0:11:39.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're right. Too big to be plums...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.71,0:11:42.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Too hard to be kiwis...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.67,0:11:46.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,These are from that tree, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.13,0:11:48.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's it!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.46,0:11:51.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,These are probably walnuts!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.96,0:11:55.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'd always thought they\Ngrew looking like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.58,0:11:57.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is that the seed?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.58,0:11:59.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.54,0:12:01.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can eat what's inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.88,0:12:04.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,But they're hard,\Nso you need special tools.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.50,0:12:07.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I've cracked one.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.83,0:12:09.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now that's some power!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.38,0:12:11.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is it safe to eat?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,I dunno...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.54,0:12:13.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Might be best to cook it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.38,0:12:15.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Might be best to cook it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.38,0:12:15.13,Q4,,0,0,0,,Walnuts...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.17,0:12:18.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,This tree is bearing fruit, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.88,0:12:22.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Smaller than the walnuts.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.63,0:12:25.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's a seed in this too.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:25.25,0:12:27.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Do we have to break them?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.96,0:12:31.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Pulverized!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.42,0:12:33.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's an almond!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.63,0:12:35.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Next is almonds...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.79,0:12:40.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,If we've got walnuts and almonds,\NI think I can figure out the rest.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.38,0:12:43.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,This doesn't seem to bear any fruit.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.46,0:12:46.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is it some sort of leafy vegetable?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.25,0:12:48.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Or maybe some kind of potato?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Not too far from that, actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.25,0:12:57.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,These peanuts grow underground\Nin the same way.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.29,0:12:59.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,What an odd shape.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.67,0:13:01.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now we have peanuts...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,They look much like beans.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.42,0:13:06.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,True. I wonder what they technically are.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.21,0:13:10.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Walnuts, almonds, and peanuts.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.13,0:13:12.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now it all comes back to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.42,0:13:12.75,Q4,,0,0,0,,Nuts! Nuts! Nuts!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.75,0:13:14.92,Q4,,0,0,0,,Nuts! Nuts! Nuts!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.75,0:13:14.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I was dying for a handful of
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.92,0:13:17.54,Q4,,0,0,0,,Nuts! Nuts! Nuts!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.92,0:13:17.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,mixed nuts back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.54,0:13:20.42,Q4,,0,0,0,,Nuts! Nuts! Nuts!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.54,0:13:20.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,If I'd thought of beer back then,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.42,0:13:23.08,Q4,,0,0,0,,Beer! Beer! Beer!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.42,0:13:23.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this would be a field of wheat now.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.08,0:13:23.79,Q4,,0,0,0,,Beer! Beer! Beer!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.79,0:13:27.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,But if this is the nut field,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.79,0:13:30.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,what's with that colorful fruit there?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.58,0:13:34.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Judging by the color,\Nperhaps it's a fruit like an apple?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.83,0:13:36.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Or maybe something for curry?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.83,0:13:39.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,That spicy... what was it again?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,Chili pepper?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.75,0:13:44.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hmm, doesn't really seem like a pepper.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.71,0:13:50.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,Given all the nuts we've found,\Nthe answer should be obvious.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.38,0:13:52.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nsticking out of the bottom.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.21,0:13:55.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,The shape nearly gives it away,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.88,0:13:59.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,but you're still left thinking,\N"This can't be how they grow, right?"
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.33,0:14:03.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Do we eat what's inside this shell too?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.38,0:14:05.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,How is everyone so strong?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.33,0:14:08.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I knew it, cashews.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.21,0:14:12.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Never expected them to hang off like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.08,0:14:14.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,How did they evolve this way?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.71,0:14:20.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,The fruit was like a sort of astringent mix\Nbetween an apple and a pear.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.08,0:14:23.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Roast them over a flame\Nand they come out like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,They're so pleasantly fragrant.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.71,0:14:28.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'd pair well with tea.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.46,0:14:31.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,These would fly off the shelves\Nif sold in the Demonic Kingdom.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.79,0:14:35.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Good thinking. They're easy to trade\Nbecause they keep long too.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.58,0:14:38.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,I should try growing more new things\Nwhen I get the chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.67,0:14:44.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,I wonder if we'll ever encounter\Nanything as peculiar as cashews.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.54,0:14:46.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Farming Life!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.46,0:14:48.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,In Another World!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.88,0:14:49.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,2!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you a story about a slime.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.04,0:15:03.08,Q6,,0,0,0,,Lives near water
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.04,0:15:03.08,Q5,,0,0,0,,Slime
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.71,0:15:03.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,One day, a slime that purified our water
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.17,0:15:05.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,fell into a wine barrel
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,and transformed into a wine slime.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.83,Q6,,0,0,0,,Specialty: Drunken Breath
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.83,Q5,,0,0,0,,Wine Slime
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.29,0:15:12.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ever since, that slime would\Nshow up at every event,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.42,0:15:15.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,trying to get some more to drink.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.67,0:15:19.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,But we never knew much more about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.29,0:15:22.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Here goes then!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.38,0:15:23.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.13,0:15:25.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.67,0:15:29.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Nice. That worked well.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.04,0:15:31.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mayor!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.54,0:15:33.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.33,0:15:35.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Testing out a parachute.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's a parachute?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.79,0:15:42.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Something to keep me safe if I ever\Naccidentally fall off your backs mid-flight.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.46,0:15:46.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why not just land on the ground like normal?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.67,0:15:50.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Some of us can't, you know.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.67,0:15:55.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,That worked well enough,\Nbut I doubt it can handle much weight.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.54,0:15:58.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,We could make it bigger,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.21,0:16:01.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,but I bet it will get bulky and tangled.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.04,0:16:02.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Wine slime?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.46,0:16:08.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,You want to go for a ride?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.04,0:16:11.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure it's safe.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.71,0:16:14.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Such a low height will be no issue.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.71,0:16:16.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.00,0:16:21.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Out of respect for the wine slime's bravery,\NI let it take our first test flight.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.83,0:16:23.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.79,0:16:26.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.08,0:16:36.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it cared about\Nanything but alcohol,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.54,0:16:39.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,but maybe it can be our\Ntest pilot from now on.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.17,0:16:41.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.46,0:16:42.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.38,0:16:44.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you okay...?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Seems fine, I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.79,0:16:49.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Maybe it got bored?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.42,0:16:51.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Definitely faster to jump.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.38,0:16:54.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,It remains a creature shrouded in mystery,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.71,0:16:57.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,but one thing's for sure-\Nit's as carefree as they come.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.50,0:17:12.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.71,0:17:13.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lady Ya.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.63,0:17:17.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'd like to discuss our production plan.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.13,0:17:19.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Incredible, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.29,0:17:22.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Were we not asked to make a standard bowl?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.38,0:17:25.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,This can hold everyone's food at once!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.08,0:17:27.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Bigger things are better than smaller ones!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.75,0:17:31.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,That didn't work, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.42,0:17:34.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I need to make it thicker and stronger.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.04,0:17:36.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'd ask that you make it smaller first...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.63,0:17:41.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,My name is Hiterto,\Nand I am Lady Ya's assistant.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.00,0:17:48.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,The two of us grew up together,\Nand I was meant to take lead.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.29,0:17:53.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,However, I felt myself more suited\Nas an assistant and declined.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.92,0:17:58.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,This forced Lady Ya to take the role,\Nbut I believe this worked out in the end.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.75,0:18:06.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,After enduring a great many things,\Nour people arrived at the Great Tree Village.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.46,Q4,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so much delicious food!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.29,Q4,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so much delicious food!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Here we've found fantastic cuisine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.29,0:18:12.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,and steamy baths.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.13,0:18:12.83,Q4,,0,0,0,,This water isn't cold!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.13,0:18:12.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,and steamy baths.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.83,0:18:14.04,Q4,,0,0,0,,This water isn't cold!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.04,0:18:15.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,And sleep now in warm beds.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.38,0:18:16.21,Q4,,0,0,0,,This doesn't hurt my back!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.38,0:18:16.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,And sleep now in warm beds.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.21,0:18:17.88,Q4,,0,0,0,,This doesn't hurt my back!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.21,0:18:17.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,This may be the first time our people\Nhave ever enjoyed such luxury.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.88,0:18:21.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,This may be the first time our people\Nhave ever enjoyed such luxury.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.75,0:18:26.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,We are ever grateful to the\NGreat Tree Village for welcoming us in.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.96,0:18:29.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,But as assistant to my people's leader,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.29,0:18:34.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I must also consider how we might\Ncontinue enjoying such comforts.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.83,0:18:36.08,Q4,,0,0,0,,One drink and the world goes round!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.08,0:18:39.58,Q4,,0,0,0,,One drink and the world goes round!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.08,0:18:39.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lady Ya does not seem to\Nconcern herself with such thoughts.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.67,0:18:45.50,Q1,,0,0,0,,What is most important is for our people\Nto show we benefit the village.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.17,0:18:52.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, our dexterous nature has\Nallowed us to make significant contributions.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.00,Q4,,0,0,0,,Now, as for who will handle what...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.00,0:18:55.00,Q4,,0,0,0,,Now, as for who will handle what...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.00,0:18:55.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Equally as important is
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Equally as important is
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.25,0:19:02.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,our relationship with the mayor,\Nthe village's most important figure.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.71,0:19:07.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,As far as I can tell, the mayor engages\Nwith all residents on equal grounds.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.08,0:19:11.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,He does not appear to choose favorites.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.21,0:19:15.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,But it would serve us well\Nto earn his favor, regardless.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.96,0:19:20.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, Lady Ya appears\Nwilling to do just that.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.71,0:19:22.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.17,0:19:25.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Is something bothering you?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.38,0:19:26.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ya?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.17,0:19:28.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.96,0:19:30.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.21,0:19:31.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,Very okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.54,0:19:32.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's good, I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.79,0:19:34.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,But she's far too obvious.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.67,0:19:39.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, I... respect him.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.17,0:19:44.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,That settles it, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.58,0:19:47.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Let's do all we can to earn his favor!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.63,0:19:48.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.46,0:19:50.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll assist you!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.21,0:19:53.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.58,0:20:02.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,How about that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.79,0:20:04.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,How about what?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.08,0:20:07.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,I've trained this hard to catch\Nthe mayor's attention!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.92,0:20:09.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.42,0:20:11.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,I went heavier with each attempt.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.75,0:20:14.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,And now I can lift a boulder this large!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I asked why, not how!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.04,0:20:19.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,You do not need muscles\Nto catch his attention.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.75,0:20:20.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.83,0:20:22.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.33,0:20:27.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,Haven't we always said a strong physical form\Nis the way to win over a man?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.00,0:20:29.75,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's the way to win\Na struggle of brute strength!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.75,0:20:30.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,That's the way to win\Na struggle of brute strength!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.75,0:20:30.67,Q4,,0,0,0,,Got ya!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.67,0:20:31.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,Got ya!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.88,0:20:37.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,I can't deny that some of our old stories\Ntalk of things like that,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.29,0:20:41.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,but that will never serve our purpose\Nin the Great Tree Village!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.08,0:20:44.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.88,0:20:48.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,Because all the other residents\Nare far stronger.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.58,0:20:51.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,I saw as much during\Nthe martial arts competition.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.04,0:20:54.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,But I'll never win him\Nif I can't defeat them!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.83,0:20:57.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,We're not trying to capture him!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.54,0:21:01.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's best to show you what I mean.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.25,0:21:04.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ya?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.00,0:21:06.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,What did you want to show me?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Lady Ya.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.42,0:21:10.63,Q1,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.92,0:21:15.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Well?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.38,0:21:18.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is the heaviest boulder I've ever lifted.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.71,0:21:21.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,But I can go heavier!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.54,0:21:23.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.13,0:21:25.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,Put that down. It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.75,0:21:29.38,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.38,0:21:30.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.58,0:21:34.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Some things can't be solved with brute force...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.29,0:21:37.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,There are few things that can be, in fact.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.58,0:21:40.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's work on other methods.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.88,0:21:42.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.29,0:21:47.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'll try showing off my incredible abs instead!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.71,0:21:50.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Why is it always about muscles with you?!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.58,0:21:53.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,We need to tackle this head-on.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.13,0:21:57.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,We'll want to use every weapon\Nyou have to its full potential....
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.83,0:22:01.04,Q1,,0,0,0,,So perhaps we should focus on\Nthose legs and rear.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.42,0:22:02.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,What are you basing that decision on?!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.83,0:22:04.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,You know I'm sensitive about that stuff!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.25,0:22:06.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,This is for the sake of our people.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.08,0:22:11.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Then I'll... work on\Nmy chest muscles!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.33,0:22:15.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Enough with the muscles!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.92,0:22:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lala lalalala...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.75,0:22:25.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lala lalalala...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.08,0:22:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,A white cloud floating in the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.58,0:22:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The dazzling first star of the night
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.08,0:22:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The sun goes down before you know it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.79,0:22:38.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even somewhat gloomy days
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.25,0:22:40.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Might get you one step closer
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.67,0:22:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow should be another good day
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.04,0:22:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,As the wind blows gently by
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.21,0:22:54.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The heart is cleansed
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.04,0:22:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.54,0:22:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can keep at it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.33,0:23:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,As long as you are by my side
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.88,0:23:11.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's sing so we don't forget today
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.29,0:23:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that we can smile again tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.00,0:23:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if we cry again sometime
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.67,0:23:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll always be by your side
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.75,0:23:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready one, two, and three-let's dance!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.38,0:23:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who cares if we just watch and learn?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.79,0:23:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make bad steps
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.00,0:23:35.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn't bother me
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.71,0:23:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want us to sing a song
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.92,0:23:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And leave everyone smiling
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.38,0:23:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should make these days last forever
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.29,0:23:50.96,Q7,,0,0,0,,Fine Day for Visitors
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.29,0:23:50.96,Q5,,0,0,0,,Episode 6
